**Feature pages (`src/app/features/`)**
- `dashboard/` — now wired to real data (was static "0" placeholders):
  player/match counts, average/highest Elo, most wins, highest win rate,
  a leaderboard preview and a recent-matches preview.
- `leaderboard/` — rank badges, tier filter, name search, and a
  season/all-time toggle when a season is active.
- `matches/record-match.component.ts` — added the confirmation preview
